1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,111
High performers don't struggle because
they lack discipline.

2
00:00:03,111 --> 00:00:07,032
They struggle because they're running at
a level where the volume of life —

3
00:00:07,032 --> 00:00:13,028
work, family, responsibilities, decisions — is
genuinely complex. 

4
00:00:13,028 --> 00:00:17,322
And no system was ever built to match that complexity.

5
00:00:17,322 --> 00:00:21,468
So they do what they always do: they
figure it out. They hold the map in their head.

6
00:00:21,468 --> 00:00:24,752
They switch context. They catch
things before they fall.

7
00:00:24,752 --> 00:00:27,306
And it works. Until it doesn't.

8
00:00:27,306 --> 00:00:31,167
We built Mainthread because we believe
the most capable people in the world

9
00:00:31,167 --> 00:00:33,947
shouldn't have to be their own operating
system.

10
00:00:33,947 --> 00:00:39,633
One platform for your whole life and work —
structured, prioritized, and carefully managed.

11
00:00:39,633 --> 00:00:43,987
A priority engine that tells you
exactly what today requires. 

12
00:00:44,087 --> 00:00:49,061
Agents that handle execution on your behalf and ask
before they act.

13
00:00:49,061 --> 00:00:54,502
It's not another productivity app. It's a
system equal to the life you're actually running -

14
00:00:54,502 --> 00:00:57,213
a true productivity platform for high
performers.
